 text, the honest minimal build is: (1) add the requirement-reference carrier to the inventory and a checker for all four classes; (2) declare unmapped and unresolved WARN initially; (3) mint the direct TC that drives each class on a scaffold — a file with no mapping is REPORTED, which is the true state, so the TC claims exactly what it exercises. Round 013's false-coverage objection and round 019's direct-TC ask BOTH dissolve, and no derived-TC type is needed for this SR. The authoring pass — filling a reference for every inventory row — becomes a visible warn-count burn-down instead of a precondition, which re-scopes the deferred WI-543 from \"author the whole join first\" to mechanism + burn-down. The wi508 branch's four Drafted rows stay honest as-is (they verify the delivered arms only).\n3068-\n3069-A GENERAL RULE THE OWNER RECALLED, found NOWHERE in the repo (searched the rulings, the log and the process masters this session): an LLR can be satisfied by its parent, but an SR cannot be satisfied by its children unless the children span the SR's full dimensional space and are not interdependent. Not load-bearing for SR-163 under the direction above (its children do not span its space today, and the direct TC makes the question moot here), but worth writing into the spine-authoring doctrine as its own act if wanted.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
